 "说明：令牌只写进 config.json，不会回显/记录；「测试连接」只探测 ${地址}/api/（4 秒超时），不保存配置。": "Description: The token is only written to config.json, and will not be echoed/recorded; \"Test Connection\" only detects $ {address}/api/(4 seconds timeout), and does not save the configuration.",
 "说明：底噪长期高于 5% 时唤醒词分数会被噪声抬高，容易出现误唤醒；": "Explanation: When the bottom noise is higher than 5% for a long time, the awakening word score will be raised by the noise, which is prone to false awakening;",
